# Everything under data/ is a build product of tools/synth_flows.py and the
# detection runner. The manifest in particular embeds base_time, which defaults
# to "now", so a tracked copy shows as modified after every single run and buries
# real changes in the diff. It is deterministic from --seed, so regenerating it
# costs nothing:
#     python tools/synth_flows.py -o data/features.jsonl
data/

